{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：删除Azure恢复服务资源。对应需求：影响破坏。官方：Azure Recovery Services Resource Deleted。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-azure.activitylogs-*","filebeat-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：删除Azure恢复服务资源","references":["https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2023/07/25/storm-0501-ransomware-attacks-expanding-to-hybrid-cloud-environments/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"b8c3e5d0-8a1a-11ef-9b4a-f661ea17fbce","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: 跨平台","主题: 影响破坏","来源: 默认","对应需求: 影响破坏"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"event.dataset:azure.activitylogs and\n    azure.activitylogs.operation_name:MICROSOFT.RECOVERYSERVICES/*/DELETE and\n    event.outcome:(Success or success)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1490","name":"Inhibit System Recovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1490/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0040","name":"Impact","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0040/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"azure","version":"*"}],"note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：删除Azure恢复服务资源\n\n### 为何重要\n破坏可用性或加密数据\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","cloud.account.id","process.name","process.command_line","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","event.action","message"]},"version":2,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fie